        "metadata": {
          "category": "stories",
          "media": {
            "duration": 223,
            "fileSize": 2725932
          },
          "author": "Anna Dewdney",
          "description": "Time to pick up all your toys!\nWhy is Mama making noise?\nMama says it's cleaning day.\nLlama only wants to play.\n \nAnna Dewdney's Llama Llama is growing up, but he still loves to play with all his toys! When Mama Llama says it's time to clean up, Llama responds like any child more interested in playing than cleaning...by ignoring her! But Mama has an imaginative response of her own. What if she never cleaned? What would happen then? Well, Llama Llama is going to find out! Here is a truly funny take on a childhood chore that all children will relate to and laugh at! And it is sure to be helpful to get kids cleaning up!",
